    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dichroic stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence at normal angle. Initialize thicknesses from iteration_12 best candidate: [77.71, 177.76, 65.96, 87.63, 94.31, 100.73, 236.5, 85.64, 126.52, 87.8, 60.22, 87.68, 209.35, 88.73, 63.43, 79.31, 63.65, 84.16, 163.16, 212.54, 63.22, 82.93, 177.9, 68.43] nm. Apply gradient-based thickness optimization with bounds 50-280 nm for all layers. Impose localized smoothing constraint on layers 12-15 (indices 11-14 zero-based) limiting thickness change to +/-10% per optimization step. Evaluate coherent TMM at normal incidence unpolarized. Score candidates by mean transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and mean reflectance in 400-700 nm band with equal weighting. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 30.",
